      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS BEAR (7) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and two placings from 12 starts. Below best last time at this track (25.59) in a Free For All, finishing a 6 length fourth. Has the ability and should feature. WILDASH JANE (8) box seated off the lead and kept coming to win (25.19) at this track in Free For All over 457m. The form from her last run stacks up well. One of main contenders. BLUE ART (1) looks close to another win after finishing third last time (25.39) at Grafton. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Expected to feature again. BAREFOOT ELSA (5) has been a model of consistency and deserves plenty of thought.",
